				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Reports collect data about a running image, to analyse problems later: slowdowns, stuck processes, garbage collections, memory use. Every report carries the image data ({{gtClass:GtReportImageData}}): the GT, GT VM, Pharo VM and Pharo image versions, and nothing that identifies the user or the machine. How to analyse stored reports is on {{gtPage:Analysing stored GT reports}}; how the infrastructure works and how to add a report is on {{gtPage:Report infrastructure for collecting data in GT}}."
			},
