				"string" : "Each section below has two or three snippets: the first creates the report (inspect it), the next stores it ({{gtMethod:GtProcessesReport>>#storeIn:|label=#selector}}). A report can also be stored from the inspector with its *Save locally* action ({{gtMethod:GtProcessesReport>>#gtSaveLocallyActionFor:|label=#selector}}), and a recorder can record and store in one go ({{gtMethod:GtReportRecorder>>#gtRecordAndSaveLocallyActionFor:|label=#selector}})."
			},
