							"string" : "Profiles the whole image for 30 seconds ({{gtMethod:GtMessageTallyReportRecorder>>#initialize|label=#selector}}) in a background process, so the UI stays usable and what you do in it is profiled ({{gtClass:GtMessageTallyReport}}, {{gtClass:GtMessageTallyReportRecorder}}). Inspect the recording ({{gtClass:GtReportRecording}}): the report shows up in it when the recording ends. It is stored as the text report plus a JSON file with the other data."
