							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The memory taken by the instances and the code of every class ({{gtClass:GtSpaceTally}}), together with the VM memory statistics ({{gtClass:GtSpaceTallyReport}}, {{gtClass:GtSpaceTallyReportRecorder}}). Recording takes a few seconds in a background process, and the image freezes while the VM walks the heap. Inspect the recording: the report shows up in it when the recording ends. The report is stored as gzipped STON, about 3 MB for a large image; storing takes about 40 seconds, and reading it back about a minute. Read a stored file back with {{gtClass:GtSpaceTallyReport}} {{gtMethod:GtSpaceTallyReport class>>#fromGzippedSton:|label=#selector}}."
						},
