							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A recorder can also record in the background and store the report itself ({{gtMethod:GtReportRecorder>>#recordLocallyInBackground|label=#selector}}, or {{gtMethod:GtReportRecorder>>#recordInBackgroundInto:|label=#selector}} for another store). The recording shows the report, the stored files ({{gtMethod:GtReportRecording>>#gtStoredFilesFor:|label=#selector}}) and the written files themselves ({{gtMethod:GtReportRecording>>#gtFolderFor:|label=#selector}}) once it has ended."
